text":"Thick-restart Lanczos (Wu–Simon) with full reorthogonalization and locking on σI − M (σ","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Gershgorin’s bound), from a fixed start vector; once k pairs are found, a run on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"complement of their vectors checks that no copy of a multiple eigenvalue was missed. A Ritz","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pair is accepted when its residual is at most ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"text":" · max(|λ|, s\/1000), s Gershgorin’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bound on the spectrum; the vectors are then rotated by Rayleigh–Ritz on M, whose values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returned. The dense solver below 64 vertices, or when k is a third of them or more.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"O((n + m) · products + n · k²) time, O(n · k) ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"text":"s for the vectors and n · max(30, 2k +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"10) for the basis.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"weight","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gives the weight of the edge at each position, read once per position; a weight of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"0 is no edge.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"smallest"},{"type":"text","text":" is in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0...vertexCount"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance > 0"},{"type":"text","text":", every weight is finite"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and nonnegative, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is at least 1."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineCo